# "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell" (CR 603.2): Bot1's own creature spell (Ornithopter) and Bot2's noncreature
# spell (Mox Sapphire) trigger neither the Monk nor the Mentor's prowess, and Bot1's own noncreature spell on turn 3 does
# both. Prowess lasts until end of turn (CR 514.2): on Bot2's turn 4 the Mentor is a 2/2 again and the Monk a 1/1.

